44\r\n\r\nThis PR changes astcenc's build configuration to allow decompressing ASTC formats in non-editor builds. This will be useful for devices which don't support ASTC formats (especially the HDR variants).\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Find out whether Angle needs the compressor as well and enable it accordingly.\r\n\r\nMRP:\r\n[astc-runtime.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18285222/astc-runtime.zip)\r\n\r\nTesting: Export the project using the custom export template from this PR. Before this PR, the results would vary depending on whether Angle was enabled by default. The Windows version (with Angle, and therefore astcenc always enabled) looked like this:\r\n![old](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a1ca4def-4557-4bb2-91b5-d770648bd8df)\r\n\r\nNow, every version should look like this: \r\n![new](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d4658af-b92c-4fc6-9f4b-22ed465468e0)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20